ung a lot from year to year (CV 0.89).","Earnings quality looks solid: cash conversion of 1.09x.","ROE of 17% comes mostly from margins and asset turnover rather than leverage (1.6x equity multiplier).","Operating margin is running 13pp above its own historical average, a peak-margin risk if conditions normalise.","It spends 2.3% of revenue on stock compensation (above the 2% gate)."],"hlth":["Leverage is conservative at 0.8x net debt to EBITDA ($327.4M of cash against $560.4M of debt), with interest covered 7.2x.","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 2.67)."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 7.3% over 3 years and 8.8% over 5 years, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 41%).","Free cash flow has compounded 22.2% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: deferred revenue down 74%.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (1.1x, 17.6% of sales), a maintenance pace."],"own":["Insiders own 13.9%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 77%.","Insider trading is two-way: 1 purchase and 11 sales over the past year, net $7.8M sold.","It returns 5.9% a year to shareholders (0.4% in buybacks and 8.9% in dividends).","The share count has grown 1.4% a year over five years, diluting existing holders."],"people":["With about 602 employees, each generates about $800K of revenue, 0.4x the Energy median, and revenue has grown 14.9% a year across its filed history.","CEO pay is $3.4M (4x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $18K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"INVEST","conv":89,"head":"Invest: trades 20% below fair value of $55.43; revenue grew 8.8%/yr over 5y.","pros":["Composite 42, above the 39 line (gates 12/26)","Trades 20% below fair value of $55.43","Revenue grew 8.8%/yr over 5y","Net debt/EBITDA 0.8x","P/E 3.9x vs sector 12.8x"],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":47.12,"vc":{"base":55.43,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":55.43,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.0603,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"m